{
  "inShort": "Behind on demonstrated progress: nothing shown establishes a playable slice, so actual progress remains unknown. The landscape photo and film thumbnail verify neither the second island nor reef damage; no build or five-player test notes were shared. Mia did not confirm work this week, so the slice’s available development time beyond Alex’s 10–15 weekly hours remains unknown.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtjvqa407chnxz8px563av7",
      "text": "The public repository task is done. Inspection confirmed Godot demo folders, an MIT license and import instructions, not a playable slice of this game."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtjvqc007cinxz8malbx2fr",
      "text": "The animated art-style reference task remains done. Inspection identified Big Buck Bunny from its title and thumbnail, but did not verify the animation. The sprint’s video link points to that film, not game footage."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtjvqcw07cjnxz8pdhgkj7t",
      "text": "The playtesting reference task is done. Inspection confirmed an article explaining playtesting and its formats. It does not establish that five players tested this game."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtjvqds07cknxz8v6h3pm2y",
      "text": "The private design board task is recorded as done through “Design board.” Its contents were not inspected."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [
    "cmvtjvqem07clnxz8as1uzyd7"
  ],
  "outsidePlan": [],
  "questions": [
    "Is there an openable build showing both islands, the tide loop and two-player sailing?",
    "Did five players test that build, and what did their notes establish?"
  ]
}

